  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knowledge cooperation on renewable energy from the Netherlands to Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to connect the Dutch and Mozambican energy triple helix organizations (government, private sector, knowledge institutions) in the context of two relevant events organized by the European Union Delegation in Mozambique: the EU-Mozambique Global Gateway Investment Forum (22-23 November)  and the III Bbusiness Conference Renewables-in-Mozambique 2023 (24 November). The project provides direct support to the Netherlands embassy in Maputo with the identification of the Dutch added value on energy transition in Mozambique. The project includes the design and implementation of a study visit of Dutch private and knowledge organizations from the Netherlands with focus on renewable energy. This study visit is a key enabling environment intervention of the Netherlands embassy in Mozambique towards the promotion of sustainable energy transition in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
