       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- The report:rovides a detailed account of the meetings with stakeholders held during the scoping mission and analyses the areas where the Netherlands can contribute significantly to  Mozambique&#x2019;s energy transition. . It includes a roadmap to be used by EKN-Map for supporting the implementation of Mozambique&#x2019;s Energy Transition Strategy. This can assist the Dutch embassy in Mozambique to develop a climate and renewable energy portfolio.

